-- title:
--   Stable complements in the unitary principal series of GL₃
-- statement:
--   Fix a finite place $v$ of $\mathbb{Q}$, i.e. a point of the height-one spectrum of $\mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{Q}}$, and write $\mathbb{Q}_v$ for the $v$-adic completion; `LocalGL3 v` is $\mathrm{GL}_3(\mathbb{Q}_v)$. Let $\chi = (\chi_0,\chi_1,\chi_2)$ be a triple of monoid homomorphisms $\mathbb{Q}_v^{\times} \to \mathbb{C}^{\times}$ (no continuity is assumed), subject to the hypothesis `hunit` that $\lVert \chi_i(x)\rVert = 1$ for every $i$ and every $x \in \mathbb{Q}_v^{\times}$. Here `principalSeries3 v χ` is the $\mathbb{C}$-subspace of functions $f : \mathrm{GL}_3(\mathbb{Q}_v) \to \mathbb{C}$ that are locally constant, satisfy $f(u g) = f(g)$ for every upper triangular unipotent $u =$ `upperUnipotent3 x y z` with $x,y,z \in \mathbb{Q}_v$ and every $g$, and satisfy $f(\mathrm{diag}(a_0,a_1,a_2)\,g) = \bigl(\prod_i \chi_i(a_i)\bigr)\cdot(\lVert a_0\rVert/\lVert a_2\rVert)\cdot f(g)$ for all $a_i \in \mathbb{Q}_v^{\times}$ and all $g$. Let $U$ be a $\mathbb{C}$-subspace of the functions $\mathrm{GL}_3(\mathbb{Q}_v) \to \mathbb{C}$ with $U \le$ `principalSeries3 v χ`, and assume $U$ is stable under every right translation operator $f \mapsto (h \mapsto f(hg))$, stated as $U \le U.\mathrm{comap}$ of `gl3AmbientRightTranslate g` for all $g \in \mathrm{GL}_3(\mathbb{Q}_v)$. The conclusion asserts the existence of a subspace $U'$ of the same ambient function space, contained in `principalSeries3 v χ`, likewise stable under all right translations, with $U \sqcap U' = \bot$ and $U \sqcup U' =$ `principalSeries3 v χ`.
--
--   This is the complete reducibility statement for the normalised principal series of $\mathrm{GL}_3(\mathbb{Q}_v)$ attached to a unitary triple of characters: every right-translation-stable subspace admits a right-translation-stable complement inside the series. It is used in the cubic induction package, via [`LanglandsTunnell.CubicInduction.forall_mem_gl3CyclicSubspace_of_mem_gl3CyclicSubspace_coefficientFn`](thm.html#LanglandsTunnell.CubicInduction.forall_mem_gl3CyclicSubspace_of_mem_gl3CyclicSubspace_coefficientFn), to control cyclic subspaces generated by vectors of the local principal series.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_LanglandsTunnell_CubicInduction_exists_compl_of_forall_le_comap_gl3AmbientRightTranslate.lean

